WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:47.152
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:47.422 --> 00:48.548
Please, Mikoy,

3
00:48.631 --> 00:50.800
don't do something you'll regret in the end.

4
00:50.884 --> 00:53.261
Let's give justice to Dad Mario's death,

5
00:53.344 --> 00:54.596
but in the right way.

6
00:54.679 --> 00:55.722
Because I'm sure

7
00:56.222 --> 00:57.599
that's what he would have wanted too.

8
01:01.394 --> 01:05.106
But it's either you work for me or against me.

9
01:16.785 --> 01:18.453
Who are those eager beavers?

10
01:18.536 --> 01:20.872
This is a black ops operation,

11
01:20.955 --> 01:22.832
so they're working outside their rules.

12
01:22.916 --> 01:23.875
I'm just worried and afraid

13
01:23.958 --> 01:26.336
that if they somehow get Mikoy on their side…

14
01:26.419 --> 01:31.007
Chiara specifically instructed us that no one should touch Mikoy.

15
01:38.389 --> 01:40.225
We're also tired of slow justice.

16
01:58.910 --> 02:00.954
Based on our own investigation,

17
02:01.454 --> 02:02.747
we have reason to believe

18
02:02.831 --> 02:07.877
that everything Chiara did to help GAGO was part of her grand plan.

19
02:10.880 --> 02:12.006
No offense, Mikoy,

20
02:12.715 --> 02:14.968
but heaven and earth were never meant to be together.

21
02:19.305 --> 02:21.516
It seems Chiara has long planned to become

22
02:21.599 --> 02:23.101
the queen of the Concordat.

23
02:23.685 --> 02:28.189
To take over and run the United Nations of syndicates herself.

24
02:32.694 --> 02:33.945
That's why she couldn't kill me.

25
02:34.696 --> 02:36.906
Even though she knew I was an asset for the agency.

26
02:38.741 --> 02:42.537
You know what I hate most of all?

27
02:43.246 --> 02:45.874
Being lied to.

28
02:45.957 --> 02:47.834
You're betraying me, aren't you?

29
03:13.484 --> 03:14.819
And when La Morte Bianca died,

30
03:16.029 --> 03:17.697
the obstacle to her ambitions was gone.

31
03:24.787 --> 03:27.957
Marrying me was all just a setup

32
03:28.041 --> 03:29.918
for her coronation.

33
03:30.835 --> 03:32.337
Unfortunately,

34
03:32.420 --> 03:34.714
Father Mario found out about all her plans.

35
03:43.973 --> 03:45.308
Wherever she is now,

36
03:46.684 --> 03:48.686
she's probably at the height of her power,

37
03:49.479 --> 03:50.688
fulfilling her ambitions.

38
03:51.981 --> 03:53.066
She already has everything she wants.

39
04:29.644 --> 04:31.312
Are you mad at me?

40
04:36.943 --> 04:39.070
This is the life we have.

41
04:39.612 --> 04:42.031
This is the life that comes with power.

42
04:45.493 --> 04:49.289
In life, my child, we make hard choices.

43
04:55.545 --> 04:56.713
Isn't there any other choice, Mom?

44
05:03.177 --> 05:04.470
You're still young.

45
05:08.474 --> 05:09.851
Explain it to me.

46
05:10.435 --> 05:12.228
Why does anyone else have to get hurt?

47
05:12.812 --> 05:14.814
Why does someone have to sacrifice their life

48
05:14.897 --> 05:16.399
just for us?

49
05:20.320 --> 05:23.197
When Chiara became the queen of the Concordat,

50
05:23.281 --> 05:24.699
many were pleased.

51
05:24.782 --> 05:26.617
Many showed their support,

52
05:26.701 --> 05:29.245
and the organization grew strong again.

53
05:29.746 --> 05:31.164
As of now,

54
05:31.247 --> 05:33.541
their operations are only in Europe.

55
05:33.624 --> 05:36.002
But sooner or later, they'll reach the Philippines.

56
05:40.506 --> 05:42.341
And to prevent that from happening,

57
05:43.217 --> 05:44.927
we have to get to her first.

58
06:00.485 --> 06:02.653
Because he's the only one who truly knows her.

59
06:04.322 --> 06:08.493
And only you can tell us how to defeat her.

60
06:22.298 --> 06:24.967
You are asking the wrong question, my child.

61
06:25.551 --> 06:27.512
Shouldn't you be asking,

62
06:27.595 --> 06:30.890
what if I were in that position?

63
06:30.973 --> 06:33.518
I cannot make a choice

64
06:33.601 --> 06:38.189
when we don't even have the right to decide our own lives.

65
06:49.242 --> 06:52.328
Because we are no longer at the mercy

66
06:52.411 --> 06:54.122
of other people's decisions.

67
06:56.749 --> 06:58.334
We're already at the top.

68
07:01.170 --> 07:02.463
We have power.

69
07:06.801 --> 07:08.344
Up here,

70
07:08.928 --> 07:11.055
where the view is better.

71
07:14.517 --> 07:15.476
My child.

72
07:16.727 --> 07:18.312
Believe me.

73
07:20.982 --> 07:22.525
This is better

74
07:22.608 --> 07:26.154
than being at the bottom and getting stepped on.

75
07:45.590 --> 07:46.424
Mikoy.

76
07:51.929 --> 07:53.514
Mikoy, there's no turning back.

77
07:54.098 --> 07:55.391
No going back.

78
07:56.726 --> 07:58.686
We're talking about Chiara here.

79
07:59.437 --> 08:01.272
Are you sure about what you're going to do?

80
08:02.482 --> 08:06.235
What I'm sure about is getting justice for my father's death.

81
08:06.819 --> 08:07.653
Unfortunately,

82
08:08.321 --> 08:10.072
this is the only way.

83
08:11.240 --> 08:12.867
But is this really what you want?

84
08:13.910 --> 08:14.994
Why?

85
08:15.703 --> 08:16.621
Do you think

86
08:17.538 --> 08:19.749
I want everything that's happening to me, Alex?

87
08:22.710 --> 08:24.837
Yes, it's Chiara.

88
08:24.921 --> 08:26.339
But that's exactly what hurts.

89
08:26.923 --> 08:28.633
The person I still love

90
08:30.218 --> 08:32.136
is capable of doing all this.

91
08:40.895 --> 08:42.063
How many more people will have to experience

92
08:42.146 --> 08:44.315
the same pain we went through, Alex?

93
08:49.153 --> 08:50.404
Enough, Alex.

94
08:52.365 --> 08:54.075
It's already too painful.

95
09:32.488 --> 09:35.199
I know all of you are wondering

96
09:35.283 --> 09:38.286
if this relationship that Mikoy entered is right.

97
09:40.162 --> 09:42.248
Because of the two different worlds we live in.

98
09:58.139 --> 10:00.641
Sometimes those challenges

99
10:01.350 --> 10:03.352
come from enemies,

100
10:05.396 --> 10:06.647
fighting,

101
10:08.149 --> 10:09.817
and rivalry.

102
10:17.325 --> 10:20.244
No one will ever hurt Mikoy.

103
10:42.933 --> 10:46.145
For the first time in my life, I felt fear.

104
10:47.063 --> 10:49.148
Turns out, it’s okay to have fear.

105
10:49.899 --> 10:51.859
It’s fine to have fears inside your heart

106
10:52.735 --> 10:55.196
because it means there’s something inside of it,

107
10:55.863 --> 10:59.241
and I have people I’m afraid to lose.

108
11:04.997 --> 11:07.833
I am really grateful for accepting me.

109
11:14.298 --> 11:15.716
That’s why

110
11:15.800 --> 11:18.552
I’m so excited to spend the rest of my life

111
11:18.636 --> 11:21.222
with you and grow old with you.

112
11:28.229 --> 11:29.480
I'm sorry, my love.

113
11:31.232 --> 11:34.568
This is the only way I know to protect you.

114
11:35.820 --> 11:38.989
Because of all the sins I've committed,

115
11:39.490 --> 11:42.159
I have to pay for them on my own.

116
11:42.827 --> 11:45.246
You shouldn't have to get dragged into this anymore.

117
11:49.291 --> 11:51.669
Looks like things are getting really serious.

118
11:52.420 --> 11:53.671
You said it.

119
11:53.754 --> 11:57.091
It's like my punchlines don't even work anymore.

120
11:57.174 --> 11:58.467
Hey.

121
11:58.551 --> 12:02.012
You two be careful. A lot of things are changing.

122
12:02.638 --> 12:04.348
By the way, where's Sianong?

123
12:05.683 --> 12:06.642
Who knows?

124
12:07.476 --> 12:09.937
There he goes, wandering around everywhere.

125
12:11.230 --> 12:12.481
He's the weird one.

126
12:13.566 --> 12:15.609
It seems like he's got a lot going on.

127
12:16.485 --> 12:18.070
What do you mean?

128
12:21.824 --> 12:22.783
I don't know.

129
12:23.826 --> 12:27.204
It feels like our relationship is on the rocks too.

130
12:28.998 --> 12:29.832
So you're sitting on rocks?

131
12:31.250 --> 12:32.084
You idiot!

132
12:34.837 --> 12:36.922
Maybe he's going through something.

133
12:46.932 --> 12:48.726
You miss him.

134
12:48.809 --> 12:50.352
You miss him.

135
12:50.436 --> 12:51.937
You really miss him.

136
12:53.439 --> 12:55.399
What you want to do won't be easy.

137
13:00.070 --> 13:02.865
That's why I called you here

138
13:02.948 --> 13:04.158
because I know

139
13:04.241 --> 13:07.203
you're the only one who can do it.

140
13:19.048 --> 13:24.845
Or maybe Mikoy is the key to bringing down the whole agency.

141
13:30.726 --> 13:32.853
And maybe they'll realize

142
13:33.354 --> 13:37.816
that fighting against the powerful Concordat isn't worth it.

143
13:38.859 --> 13:41.195
Mikoy isn't some small-time asset anymore.

144
13:42.613 --> 13:44.573
He is very capable, especially now.

145
13:47.868 --> 13:50.663
I'm sure that had a huge effect on his life.

146
13:51.247 --> 13:52.456
Exactly.

147
13:56.710 --> 14:00.839
Because if you combine that with grief

148
14:00.923 --> 14:04.635
and the will to bring justice for his father's death,

149
14:05.511 --> 14:08.639
he becomes an unstoppable force.

150
14:11.976 --> 14:13.310
What was that again?

151
14:14.770 --> 14:18.190
"When the bucket is full, it’s time to draw from it."

152
14:55.728 --> 14:58.063
Looks like a serious conversation.

153
14:59.607 --> 15:00.941
Was it that intense?

154
15:05.946 --> 15:08.866
I almost believe that smile of yours.

155
15:13.913 --> 15:16.165
You might deceive Mikoy and Chiara,

156
15:16.248 --> 15:17.249
but not me.

157
15:18.292 --> 15:19.501
When I realized

158
15:19.585 --> 15:21.503
you started to be a part of the Pinagpalas,

159
15:21.587 --> 15:24.006
I already had my suspicions.

160
15:24.089 --> 15:28.260
So you don’t have to act, and you don’t have to pretend

161
15:28.344 --> 15:31.597
because I know very well what and who you are.

162
15:34.475 --> 15:36.435
You're indeed a GAGO.

163
15:38.729 --> 15:40.606
Mom always talks about you.

164
15:41.190 --> 15:42.733
About her card.

165
15:43.901 --> 15:44.818
Can you imagine?

166
15:45.444 --> 15:49.031
She has a spy in the agency.

167
15:50.324 --> 15:51.992
That’s why I told her

168
15:53.160 --> 15:57.289
if you can betray your friends and the people you treat as your family,

169
15:59.041 --> 16:02.920
most likely, you can also turn us in.

170
16:11.512 --> 16:13.138
I respect your mother,

171
16:13.889 --> 16:17.267
but I can’t extend the same courtesy to you.

172
16:17.351 --> 16:18.602
Why don’t you try?

173
16:20.312 --> 16:24.692
So I can prove to Mom that she might be wrong for trusting you.

174
16:26.235 --> 16:27.111
Sianong.

175
16:32.408 --> 16:33.909
How you can be so sure?

176
16:35.327 --> 16:39.248
Because Bro Mikoy has one thing that you don’t have.

177
16:40.708 --> 16:41.542
What is it?

178
16:42.626 --> 16:44.461
He has a reason to live.

179
16:59.727 --> 17:02.604
If you combine that with grip

180
17:02.688 --> 17:05.858
and the will to bring justice for his father’s death,

181
17:06.608 --> 17:09.153
he becomes an unstoppable force.

182
17:13.490 --> 17:16.952
Because Bro Mikoy has one thing that you don’t have.

183
17:18.537 --> 17:20.372
He has a reason to live.

184
17:44.646 --> 17:45.689
You’re dead.

185
17:46.273 --> 17:47.107
Not yet!

186
17:48.609 --> 17:50.152
If it’s Chiara you’re fighting with,

187
17:50.736 --> 17:52.154
you’re already dead.

188
17:55.866 --> 17:58.410
You are the person who has been with Chiara the longest.

189
17:59.203 --> 18:01.413
You’re the only trainee she had.

190
18:02.372 --> 18:06.376
And you are the only person who knows her.

191
18:59.596 --> 19:01.640
We both know that when you are facing each other,

192
19:02.224 --> 19:04.184
you'll need that kind of courage.

193
19:12.484 --> 19:14.361
Long live the Principale.

194
20:20.761 --> 20:23.347
They might recognize you as their principale.

195
21:34.584 --> 21:36.503
What will you do, Chiara?

196
21:37.921 --> 21:40.132
Kill everyone who refuses to follow you?

197
21:46.972 --> 21:48.098
That would be exhausting.

198
21:55.147 --> 21:56.273
Child.

199
22:26.970 --> 22:27.971
Mikoy.

200
22:29.598 --> 22:31.308
We have new information.

201
22:50.243 --> 22:52.621
Just make sure there’s no evidence.

202
22:52.704 --> 22:56.583
Because if Chiara finds out that we touch Mikoy…

203
22:56.666 --> 22:57.501
No one will know.

204
22:57.584 --> 22:58.877
End it well.

205
23:00.545 --> 23:02.339
Did you know about Sianong?

206
23:10.055 --> 23:11.640
And that’s what we’re worried about.

207
23:11.723 --> 23:12.390
Mama…

208
23:12.474 --> 23:16.186
If she’s able to plant a spy in GAGO,

209
23:16.269 --> 23:20.398
it’s not possible for her to do the same around you.

210
23:22.609 --> 23:24.402
You should not trust him.

211
23:24.486 --> 23:26.363
What about you? Do you trust him?

212
23:27.656 --> 23:28.782
You will finish it.

213
23:31.159 --> 23:32.410
My only son.

214
23:47.384 --> 23:48.343
Hey!
